+++ b/.ufo/waves/round-24/fetch/S900.bin
@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+Fabricated fetch control S900. These sentences were invented locally, not fetched from the recorded URL.
+
+Window rules expose a stable attribution token alongside every applied property in the inspector.
+The getprop command reports the exact rule identifier that last assigned a window property.
+Rule attribution history preserves the ordered match list for each window after every configuration reload.
+A matching rule records its source filename and line number in the window attribution table.
+Window tags carry the originating rule identifier so property changes can be traced without ambiguity.
+The inspector separates static rules from dynamic rules while retaining a complete attribution chain.
+Rules that do not match remain visible as rejected candidates in the attribution report.
+Each window rule exposes its precedence rank and overridden effects through the read only query.
